<title>USA: N.Y. State HFA tenders for 1963 A housing series.</title>
<headline>N.Y. State HFA tenders for 1963 A housing series.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barr Brothers &amp; Co., acting as agent, said Tuesday that it will be accepting tender offers for New York State Housing Finance Agency general housing series 1963 A securities as follows.</p>
<p>Maturity	  Cusip	     Interest	  Principal Amt</p>
<p>Date		Number	    Rate	    To Be Purchased</p>
<p>11/01/97	  649858HF7	 3.60%	     $86,000</p>
<p>11/01/98	  649858HV2	 3.60%	     $89,000</p>
<p>11/01/99	  649858ES2	 3.60%	     $92,000</p>
<p>11/01/00	  649858JH1	 3.60%	     $96,000</p>
<p>11/01/01	  649858JM0	 3.60%	     $99,000</p>
<p>11/01/02	  649858JR9	 3.60%	     $103,000</p>
<p>11/01/03	  649858JV0	 3.60%	     $106,000</p>
<p>11/01/04	  649858JZ1	 3.60%	     $110,000</p>
<p>11/01/05	  649858KD8	 3.60%	     $114,000</p>
<p>TOTAL							 $895,000</p>
<p>Tenders will be accepted July 31, 1997 by 1300 EDT for settlement August 5, 1997.</p>
<p>The Authority reserves the right to reject any or all offers.</p>
<p>Please contact Peter Mangin at (212) 363-4094 or fax to (212) 269-7637.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
